{
 "name": "HL · Prospects · sort replies",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Prospects: sort replies (Lesson 5.2)\nEvery reply in the outreach inbox is classified: interested, not now, stop, out of office, bounce, other.\n- stop and bounce -> straight to Suppression (checked before every send).\n- interested -> Telegram alert to Tolu with the thread and your booking link.\n- every outcome updates Prospects (reply_type), which also stops the follow-up.\n\nCredentials: Gmail (outreach inbox) on the trigger; OpenAI; Google Sheets; Telegram.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, YOUR_BOOKING_LINK, YOUR_MODEL.",
    "height": 360,
    "width": 480
   },
   "id": "06c65038-9c14-495d-b4d7-8c1d9b2901c6",
   "name": "Note 1",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -560,
    -300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "pollTimes": {
     "item": [
      {
       "mode": "everyMinute"
      }
     ]
    },
    "simple": false,
    "filters": {
     "q": "in:inbox -from:me"
    },
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "773d1de8-48f4-45e5-a9b4-451904df2f21",
   "name": "Gmail Trigger",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.1,
   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "const from = ($json.from?.value?.[0]?.address || '').toLowerCase();\nconst text = String($json.text || '').slice(0, 4000);\nconst isDaemon = /mailer-daemon|postmaster/.test(from);\n// For a bounce, the address that failed is in the body.\nconst found = (text.match(/[\\w.+-]+@[\\w-]+\\.[\\w.-]+/g) || []).map(e => e.toLowerCase()).filter(e => !/mailer-daemon|postmaster/.test(e));\nreturn { email: isDaemon ? (found[0] || '') : from, subject: $json.subject || '', text, threadId: $json.threadId || '' };\n",
    "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
   },
   "id": "99e9ed37-2d6f-41f1-95fd-4eb9a34dceaa",
   "name": "Prepare reply",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
